<body lang="EN-US" link="blue" vlink="purple" style="tab-interval: .5in">
<div class="WordSection1" style="page: WordSection1;">
<table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellpadding="0" width="720" style="width: 7.5in; mso-cellspacing: 1.5pt; background: white; border: solid #E5E5E5 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid #E5E5E5 .75pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 10.5pt 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 38px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 9pt 0.75pt 3.75pt 35.25pt; height: 38px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-size: 24.0pt; font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #086db6;"> Welcome: Verify your e-mail</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 17px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 30pt 0.75pt 27.75pt; height: 17px;">
<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align: center;line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><hr size="1" width="100%" noshade="noshade" style="color: #e5e5e5;" align="center"></div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 41px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 41px;" id="emailMainDiv">
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #66665b;"><strong>Action Required</strong></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 41px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 41.6667px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"> We have created a profile and associated you to an existing business account because of your interest in OLO Intel Subcontractor.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 41.6667px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 41.6667px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Please retain this e-mail for future reference.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 41.6667px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 41.6667px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">E-mail Address: {!Contact.Email}</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 41px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 41px;" id="emailMainDiv">
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: #66665b;"><strong>What you need to do</strong></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 20px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 20px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"><span>Please follow this </span><u><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/my-intel/dashboard.html" style="mso-style-noshow: yes;mso-style-priority: 99;color: blue;text-decoration: underline;text-underline: single;">link</a></u><span> to complete your account set up or  copying the URL into your browser</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">. </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 20px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 20px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span color="#666666" face="Tahoma, sans-serif" style="color: #666666; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 20px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 20px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"> If you feel you have received this e-mail in error, please contact <br> <a href="https://intelinside.intel.com/support" style="mso-style-noshow: yes;mso-style-priority: 99;color: blue;text-decoration: underline;text-underline: single;">Intel Customer Support</a> </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 41px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 41px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #62686e;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response.<br> To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, please add us to your address book. </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 17px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 30pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 17px;">
<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align: center;line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><hr size="1" width="100%" noshade="noshade" style="color: #e5e5e5;" align="center"></div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 55px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 9pt 0.75pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 55px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Intel is committed to protecting your privacy. For more information,<br> please see the <a href="http://www.intel.com/privacy" style="mso-style-noshow: yes;mso-style-priority: 99;color: blue;text-decoration: underline;text-underline: single;"><span style="text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;">Intel Privacy Notice.</span></a> </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 62px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 10.5pt 33pt; height: 62px;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"><a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/legal/terms-of-use.html?iid=ftr%20terms" style="mso-style-noshow: yes;mso-style-priority: 99;color: blue;text-decoration: underline;text-underline: single;"> <span style="text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;">Legal Information</span></a> | <a href="http://www.intel.com/sites/corporate/tradmarx.htm" style="mso-style-noshow: yes;mso-style-priority: 99;color: blue;text-decoration: underline;text-underline: single;"><span style="text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;">Trademarks</span></a> © Intel Corporation. All rights reserved.<br> *Other names and brands may be claimed as the property of others.<br> **Intel is not responsible for content of sites outside our intranet. </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
